(docs/BUGS_FOUND.md #103: the empty text, a text longer than the 4096
 bytes a buffer starts with, and text in several scripts all fit a text
 field, survive a copy, and read back byte for byte.)

A thing called note has
  a text called body is "héllo wörld ✓ 日本",
  a text called blank is "".

a note called wide.
Repeat 5000 times,
  Set wide's blank to "{wide's blank}y".
a note called held is wide.
Set wide's blank to "".
Print held's body.
Print "[{wide's blank}]".
a buffer called measure.
append "{held's blank}" to measure.
Print measure's size.
a buffer called script.
append "{held's body}" to script.
Print script's size.
